Subject: [PATCH/RFC 05/11] ARM: dts: koelsch: Enable watchdog support
Date: Thu,  8 Feb 2018 11:34:11 +0100
Message-Id: <1518086057-19448-6-git-send-email-geert+renesas@glider.be>
In-Reply-To: <1518086057-19448-1-git-send-email-geert+renesas@glider.be>
References: <1518086057-19448-1-git-send-email-geert+renesas@glider.be>
Sender: linux-renesas-soc-owner@vger.kernel.org
List-ID: <linux-renesas-soc.vger.kernel.org>

Enable the watchdog, so the board can be restarted by a watchdog
timeout.

Signed-off-by: Geert Uytterhoeven <geert+renesas@glider.be>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/r8a7791-koelsch.dts | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/r8a7791-koelsch.dts b/arch/arm/boot/dts/r8a7791-koelsch.dts
index a50924d12b6f37d5..c90462dbcd36c836 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/r8a7791-koelsch.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/r8a7791-koelsch.dts
@@ -499,6 +499,11 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&rwdt {
+	timeout-sec = <60>;
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &sata0 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
